OL,3,GNEWSAFighting and bullying put primary
OL,4,Aschool into special measures
OL,5,
OL,6,FFighting, bullying and poor behaviour
OL,7,Fhave led to a primary school being
OL,8,Fplaced in special measures by Ofsted.
OL,10,FInspectors found regular incidents of
OL,11,F"arguing, name-calling and fighting" in
OL,12,Flessons and during break times at
OL,13,FNetherley Park Primary School in
OL,14,FLiverpool - which was formerly known as
OL,15,FNorman Pannell Primary School.
OL,17,FMeryl Sangare, chair of governors, said
OL,18,Fthe report made for "difficult reading"
OL,19,Fbut the school was committed to making
OL,20,Fthe necessary improvements.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
